# Generated files Prettier must not check or rewrite. The format/format:check
# globs in the root package.json match `yaml`/`js`, so without this file the
# pnpm lockfile would be checked (it passes today only by coincidence — a
# regenerated lockfile with different styling would fail format:check and a
# local `pnpm format` would rewrite it) and build outputs would rely on
# Prettier's implicit .gitignore fallback (>=3.5) instead of an explicit list.
pnpm-lock.yaml
dist/
coverage/
node_modules/
.turbo/
.turbo
apps/docs/.vitepress/cache/
apps/docs/.vitepress/dist/
